<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cambio Obligatorio de Contraseña - Aula Virtual</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4">

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl w-full max-w-md p-8 flex flex-col space-y-6">
        
        <div class="text-center space-y-2">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 bg-amber-50 rounded-2xl border border-amber-100 text-amber-500 mb-2">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m0 0v2m0-2h2m-2 0H10m-3-3h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
                </svg>
            </span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Cambio de Contraseña Obligatorio</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 max-w-sm mx-auto">Para proteger tu cuenta y la integridad del sistema, debes cambiar la contraseña temporal asignada antes de poder continuar.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Errores de Validación -->
        {{#errores}}
        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 p-4 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1 font-medium shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 font-bold mb-1">
                <span>⚠️</span> <span>Se encontraron errores:</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-0.5">
                {{#.}}
                <li>{{.}}</li>
                {{/.}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/errores}}

        <form action="/password/change" method="post" class="space-y-4">
            
            <div>
                <label for="newPassword" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Nueva Contraseña:</label>
                <input type="password" id="newPassword" name="newPassword" required placeholder="Mínimo 10 caracteres"
                       class="w-full border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none">
            </div>

            <div>
                <label for="confirmPassword" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Confirmar Nueva Contraseña:</label>
                <input type="password" id="confirmPassword" name="confirmPassword" required placeholder="Repite la contraseña"
                       class="w-full border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-4 py-2.5 text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none">
            </div>

            <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 rounded-xl p-3 text-[10px] text-slate-500 space-y-1">
                <span class="font-bold text-slate-700 block uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Requisitos de Seguridad:</span>
                <p>• Debe contener por lo menos 10 caracteres.</p>
                <p>• No puede ser igual a tu número de DNI.</p>
                <p>• No puede ser igual a la contraseña temporal actual.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2">
                <a href="/logout" class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-700 transition">
                    Cerrar Sesión
                </a>
                <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs transition shadow-md shadow-blue-100">
                    Actualizar Contraseña
                </button>
            </div>

        </form>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
